Dm-aMOYQ7kNvwHTCvXt&_nc_oc=AdoEYG5X7SN6Font9iZ4hts7fPGOKnEo2z8qiwaCf2TJG1YLg5NPT-RtQHvPBfQfoAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNZnSEidunjfuh6xutQ_S2ZM_1wtiZR5YM8jTybmww6PA&oe=6AE4AC48"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Asobi: Remote Play", "keywords": ["playstation", "ps5", "cloud", "streaming", "remoteplay"], "long_description": "Asobi: Remote Play & Cloud Streaming for your PlayStation\u00ae\n\nTurn your Meta Quest into a high-quality PS Remote Play client for your PlayStation\u00ae 4 and PlayStation\u00ae 5, with real controllers, virtual buttons, and smart streaming.\n\nCore experience (free):\n\n\u2022 Remote Play from PS4 and PS5 over your local network or the internet\n\u2022 PlayStation\u00ae 5 Cloud streaming (PlayStation\u00aePlus Premium required for cloud games)\n\u2022 Multiple PSN accounts with one-tap switching\n\u2022 Game info & progress: latest trophies, currently played, and how far you've come\n\u2022 1080p / 30 fps SDR streaming: smooth, sharp, just works\n\u2022 Automatic bitrate: the app adapts quality to your network\n\u2022 Automatic console registration: pair without a PIN on the same PSN account\n\nPremium, a single one-time unlock:\n\u2022 Full DualSense, DualSense Edge, and DualShock 4 support (USB and Bluetooth)\n\u2022 HDR video: full color and contrast on supported displays\n\u2022 1080p / 60 fps streaming: double the smoothness for responsive play\n\u2022 FSR Upscaling (Quality 2K / Ultra 4K) and up to 120 fps frame generation on supported devices\n\u2022 Multiple low-latency modes for tighter Competition / Ultra Low\n\u2022 Realtime 2D to 3D conversion to add some depth to your play", "short_description": "Asobi: Remote Play & Cloud Streaming for your PlayStation\u00ae"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://asobiapp.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Inside Internet", "support_